}". This is an irreversible action. Are you sure you want to delete this?',YX="No chats to display",vF="Rename",WX="Rename conversation",xF="Search all chats",KX="Clear search",JX="AI-generated content may be incorrect",XX="Accurate/relevant content",ZX="Complete/clear content",eZ="Fast response",tZ="Inaccurate/irrelevant content",nZ="Incomplete/unclear content",oZ="Offensive/inappropriate content",rZ="Slow response",TF="Something else",sZ="Thanks for your feedback.",wF=`Sorry, I can't chat about this. Please enter another topic or try the prompt guide by selecting the "View prompts" button below.`,SF="Not now",CF="Meet our AI assistant, Ask Learn",Cx="Ask Learn is an AI assistant that can answer questions, clarify concepts, and define terms using trusted Microsoft documentation.",EF="Check for accuracy",AF="Ask Learn is in preview. Please check responses as AI-generated content may be inaccurate. Use the feedback buttons to help us improve the experience.",kF='Please read the <a class="text-decoration-underline" data-bi-name="02-link" data-bi-an="fre-modal" href="https://learn.microsoft.com/training/support/ask-learn-assistant-transparency-faq">Ask Learn transparency</a> notes to learn more about use cases and limitations.',IF="Try Ask Learn",iZ="Acknowledgement",NA="To provide more relevant and personalized responses, Ask Learn stores your chat transcripts.",aZ="Let Ask Learn use your past chats to personalize responses.",lZ="Please check the box to acknowledge the guidelines before continuing.",cZ="To use Ask Learn, you are required to acknowledge previous chat utilization. You can read more in the Ask Learn transparency notes.",uZ="Review acknowledgements",Th="Please sign in to use Ask Learn.",dZ='Sorry, I hit the maximum number of responses I can give in a conversation. Please select "New chat" to start a new conversation.',FA="More options",pZ="Maximum {max} characters",wh="New chat",mZ="See more",gZ="New message from Ask Learn",Sh="Preview",fZ="Preview what w