e the following learning outcomes:",ume="Start your plan today!",Bh="View progress",dme="Download this file to view a list of learners and their progress.",Kx="Download CSV",pme="The file contains the following information:",mme="Learner group",gme="Learn username",fme="Start date",hme="End date",bme="Items completed",_me="Items total",Ok="Learning outcomes",yme="Edit learning outcomes",vme="A learning outcome is specific knowledge, skills, or expertise that the learner will get from completing this plan.",xme="Tip: Begin each learning outcome with a verb. Each outcome should finish the sentence \u201CUpon completion of this plan, learners will be able to...\u201D",Tme="Outcome 1",wme="Outcome 2 (optional)",Sme="Outcome 3 (optional)",Cme="Outcome {number}",Eme="Convert to an official plan",Ame="Convert a plan to an official plan",kme="An official plan should be used when you want your plan to <strong>represent Microsoft</strong> and if you would like to include links that are external to Microsoft Learn. Always ensure that your plan is complete, free of typographical errors, and that content is in the correct sequence. <strong>Once an official plan is published, it cannot be altered.</strong>",Ime="To preserve any external links from an underlying Official Collection or plan, please convert to an official plan.",Lme="An official plan represents Microsoft, so please ensure that your published plan is complete, free of typographical errors, and that content is in the correct sequence.",Uk="This plan has been submitted to be localized",Pme="The plan is complete and proofread",Rme="Thank you for submitting your official plan for localization.",Mme="Mark as completed",qk="Milestone",$me="Add milestone",Dme="Edit milestone";var Nme="New milestone",Fme="Days to milestone:",Ome="1 milestone",Ume="{numberOfMilestones} milestones",qme="Milestones in this plan",Hme="Milestone completed",Bme="Move to",zme="Please confirm all milestones have a title and days to complete. You may