> for more information.';var Hk='Success! Your plan has been saved to your <a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/users/me/activity/">profile</a>.';var BO="Redeem your code now.",cge="We could not copy your code at this time. Please try again.",uge="We could not copy your URL at this time. Please try again.",dge="It looks like you have already redeemed this code.<br/>Go to your achievements page to view your achievements.",pge="You have hit your limit of 300 codes requested per day. Please try again after 12:00AM UTC.",mge="This code has hit its maximum.<br/>If you feel you are getting this message in error, please contact your instructor.",gge="We cannot find this code in our system. Please contact your instructor.",fge="Your code is ready to share!",hge="Code successfully copied!",bge="Copy code",_ge="Copy this code to give to your students to redeem on Microsoft Learn";var yge="You must copy or write down this code. Once you close this modal you will not be able to look up this code.",Bk="Copy URL",vge="Copy this URL to send your students straight to code redemption",xge="Enter your code to add your achievement(s) to your profile",Tge="Expiration date must be in the future",wge="We could not create your code at this time. Please try again.",zO="We could not redeem your code at this time. Please try again.",Sge="Add your achievement(s) to your profile",Cge="Invalid achievement category",GO="Please enter a value between 1 and 100,000.",Ege="OR",Age="Redeem",zk="Redeem your code",kge="e.g. A2CD34",Ige="It might take a couple of minutes for the badges to appear.",Lge="Codes are for our instructor-led training courses. Missing your code? Please contact your instructor.",Pge="Request achievement code",Rge="Request code",Mge="e.g. 50",$ge="Enter the number of students that will be redeeming this code",Dge="You are signed in as",Nge="We\u2019ve added your achievement(s) to your profile!",VO="More information on code",Fge="Please enter a value larger than 0",Oge="Please enter a valid code.",Uge="View profile",QO="Have an achievement code?";var qge="Save your customized collection";var Gk="Schedule exam",Hge="Schedule with Certiport",Bge="Schedule with Pearson Vue";var jO="Microsoft provides this lab experience and related content for educational purposes. All presented information is owned by Microsoft and intended solely for learning about the covered products and services in this Microsoft Learn module.";var ss="Search";var zge="Search Microsoft Learn";var YO="Search previous versions";var Jx="Seconds",Gge="{duration} seconds ago",Vge="{seconds} seconds",WO="Section";var Qge="See all activity";var Vk="See less";var Em="See more",jge="Select",Yge="Select a country or region";var Qk="Select Package";var jk="Select Version";var Am="Settings",Yk="Share",KO="I earned my {achievementTitle} {achievementType}! I\u2019m so proud to be celebrating this achievement and hope this inspires you to start your own @MicrosoftLearn journey!",Xx="[Shared Article] {articleTitle}",Wge="I completed {achievementTitle}! I'm so proud to be celebrating this achievement and hope this inspires you to start your own @MicrosoftLearn journey!";var km="Share to your feed:";var JO="Share via";var Kge="Share your achievement:",Jge="Sharing",Xge="Sharing is disabled for content requiring authorization.";var Wk="Show less",Im="Show more",Zge="Show {number} more",efe="Signed In",Ur="Sign in";var tfe="Signing in...";var zh="Sign in to start",Lm="Sign out";var nfe="Site";var ofe="Accurate/relevant content",rfe="Complete/clear content",sfe="Fast response",ife="Inaccurate/irrelevant content",afe="Incomplete/unclear content",lfe="Offensive/inappropriate content",cfe="Slow response",XO="Something else";var ufe="Skills earned upon completion",ZO="Skip";var dfe="Some items for you since your last visit",is="Hmm, something went wrong",Ot="Something went wrong. Please try again.";var Pm="GitHub";var _n="Start",pfe="Starts {startDate}";var eU="Start course";var tU="Start learning path";var mfe="Step {step-index} of {step-count}",gfe="Manage {title} in study guides",ffe="Add {title} in study guides";var co="Submit";var hfe="Submit another feedback",nU="Submit answers";var bfe="Successfully Submitted!",_fe="Thank you for submitting your feedback. We will review it shortly. Please note that feedback reporting is a one way communication and we are not responding back at this time.",yfe="Please note that although we cannot respond to feedback, our team will use your comments to improve the experience.";var vfe="Suggestions",xfe="Suggestions will filter as you type";var Tfe="Support";var wfe="Table {index}";var Sfe="Tags";var Kk="Take Assessment",Cfe="Characters left";var Efe="The file {fileName} is invalid. File type must be a valid gif, jpg, jpeg, or png image.",Afe="The file {fileName} is too large. File size cannot exceed five megabytes.",kfe="Cloud Shell",Ife="{account} already has a profile",Lfe="You have reached your account limit",Pfe="No more than five school or work accounts can be linked to one profile. Please remove one account and try again.",Rfe="{account} linked",Mfe='To access your Learn profile, you must be able to sign in using at least one of the login accounts listed below. You may add up to five work or school login accounts <figure class="image is-24x24 display-inline-block"><img alt="" aria-hidden="true" src="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/media/profile/aad-user.svg"/></figure>. Adding a work or school account allows you to share your learning progress data with your organization and take advantage of any organizational exam discounts. We strongly recommend adding a personal Microsoft login account <figure class="image is-24x24 display-inline-block"><img alt="" aria-hidden="true" src="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/media/profile/msa-user.svg"/></figure> to your profile. This ensures that you maintain access to your learning history and credentials regardless of your employment or academic status. Only one personal login account is allowed.';var $fe="You already have a linked account in the same organization",Dfe="Remove this account?",Nfe="Removing this account will delete its data from your Learn profile and stop the associated organization from receiving your Learn data. Note that your Learn profile will not be deleted.",Ffe="{account} removed",Ofe="Add login account",Ufe="Please add another account and try again.",qfe=`You can only link accounts that don't have a registered profile. Please select a different account or see our <a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/training/support/troubleshooting#user-content-account-linking">troubleshooting guidance <span class="docon docon-navigate-external" aria-hidden="true"></span></a> for more details.`;var Hfe="Other Learn login accounts",Bfe="You are adding a school or work account ({account}) to your profile. You understand and acknowledge that we may share your results and activities with your organization. You may choose to unlink this account at any time and your organization will stop receiving your learning progress data.",zfe="You have linked this account already",Gfe="{account} is a personal account. Please select a school or work account.",Vfe="Login account management",Qfe="MCID",jfe="You need at least one account linked to your profile.",Yfe="No accounts added",Wfe="Only one account per organization is supported.",Kfe="You can only have one personal account linked",Jfe="Profile is currently being merged",Xfe="You can refresh the page to check the merge status.",Zfe="Select account",oU="Please select a different account",ehe="Shared information (like name or picture) will keep the info from Profile 1.",the="There is already a certification profile connected to this profile",nhe="In order to continue, please contact customer support to remove the current certification profile to proceed.",ohe="Your data will be <strong>merged into Profile 1</strong>.",rhe="<strong>Editable information</strong> like your display name and interests can still be changed later.",rU="Notify me when merging is complete",she="Merging profiles can take several minutes. We'll let you know when the process is complete. When you opt-in to this update, we may also send you personalized recommendations, helpful tips, or Q&A notifications.",ihe="You'll get notifications at {email}.",ahe="Your email is not currently set to receive notifications and will not be enrolled after the merge.",lhe='<a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/training/support/faq?pivots=profile">Learn more</a> about merging profiles.',che="This profile has been locked",uhe="This profile is currently locked and is being merged with another profile. Please sign-in to a different profile.",sU="Retry merge",iU="Terminate merge",dhe="Here's what will happen",phe="Merge complete",mhe="Profile 1",ghe="Profile 2",fhe="You can refresh the page to check the merge status.",hhe="Profile merge record not found",bhe='Unable to find your profile merge. Please refresh the page. If the problem is still there, please contact <a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/training/support/troubleshooting#report-feedback">customer support</a>.',_he="A previous merge attempt is preventing this action",yhe="One of the profiles you are trying to merge is currently being merged with another profile. Please log into both profiles to check the status.",vhe="You're combining two Microsoft Learn profiles.",xhe="Would you like to combine your learning data into one profile?",The="Merging your data is permanent and cannot be undone, but all your learning progress including achievements, skills, and certifications will be combined in one place.",whe="Your profiles have been successfully merged.",She="We ran into a problem merging your source profile (username: {sourceUser}) to your destination profile (username: {destinationUser}).",Che="Some of your data might have been merged in the process, so it is expected if you find some data disappearing from your source profile and appearing 